<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33193" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφορ-ά</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carrying out</i>, esp. of a corpse to burial, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				1029
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				9
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				430
			</span></i> (lyr., pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἐκφορὰν βαδίζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					1008
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἐ. ἀκολουθεῖν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					1.8
				</span></i>
			; also of meats at a sacrifice, Theopomp. Com.<i><span class="en">
				70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euphro
				1.20
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1138
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κρεῶν μὴ εἶναι ἐ. ἔξω τοῦ
					τεμένεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.235.32
				</span></i>
			 (Orop.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>blabbing, betrayal of secrets</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγων
				ἀπορρήτων ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				1.98
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from 
				Pass.
			) of horses, <i>running away</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πρὸς οἶκον ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				3.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>passing out</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ πνεύματος
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>projection in a building</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				3.5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.2.2
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>utterance, pronunciation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				994.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>expression, enunciation</i> of ideas, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.58
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1112e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				371.7
			</span></i>; esp. <i>mode of expression, grammatical construction</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. προστακτική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					69.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεργητική</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				150.19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἑνικαί, πληθυντικαί</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			<i>digression</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἐ.
			ἐκπίπτειν</span> wander from the point, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.629
			</span></i>.</div>
